    "text": "```json\n{\"status\":\"ready_to_execute\",\"notes\":[\"Transition anchors checked.\",\"UI constraints checked.\",\"Inventory and state tracked.\"],\"warnings\":[],\"edge_count\":0}\n```\nCOMPLIANCE:\nScene ID: SC_001_003\nAllowed events: Rhea climbs the ridge, triggers the Starter Cache prompt, and halts before accepting upon noticing the hidden terms indicator.\nForbidden milestones: None.\n\nCurrent arm-side / inventory facts: \n- Cracked Smartphone is stowed in blazer_pocket_right.\n\nDurable changes committed: \n- Location updated to LOC_TUTORIAL_CRATER_RIDGE.\n- Milestone added: starter_cache_discovered = DONE.\n\nAPPEARANCE_CHECK:\n- char_rhea: pale skin, slender, black hair in a messy bob, dark brown eyes, Bruised Left Leg, System Indenture Brand on left wrist.\n\nPROSE:\nRhea leaves the shattered obsidian debris behind and climbs the steep, ash-choked slope toward a glowing stone pedestal that juts from the crater's ridge. \n\nEvery step is a masterclass in agony. Her bruised left leg throbs in time with her heartbeat, a dull, heavy ache that radiates up her thigh. But the real problem isn't the leg. It's the math.\n\n[HP: 1/100]\n\nWalking around with exactly one percent of your life force feels like balancing a china plate on a broomstick in a hurricane. One bad trip, one sharp rock, one enthusiastic gust of sulfur-scented wind, and it's game over. The only thing keeping her corporeal is the persistent, blinking buff in the periphery of her vision.\n\n[Status: Tutorial Grace Period (Active)]\n\nA weird, numbing static hums over her pale skin, artificially capping the pain and preventing her body from simply shutting down. It\u2019s a mechanical mercy, and Rhea inherently distrusts it. \n\nShe reaches the top of the ridge, chest heaving. The right pocket of her ruined blazer sags with the dead weight of her Cracked Smartphone. She taps the fabric once, feeling the shattered glass through the wool\u2014a useless brick of lithium and memories, but the only piece of Earth she has left. \n\nThe wasteland stretches out before her from the vantage point of the ridge. It is an endless expanse of gray dunes and jagged volcanic rock, utterly devoid of life. The sky above is a bruised, swirling purple, bleeding light like a crushed neon tube. \n\nExcept for the pedestal.\n\nIt sits ten yards away, perfectly square, carved from a smooth, pale stone that clashes violently with the surrounding geology. A soft blue light emanates from a holographic parchment hovering just above its surface. \n\nAs Rhea limps closer, the System chimes\u2014a bright, cheerful, bureaucratic ping that sets her teeth on edge. It sounds exactly like the notification tone of an HR scheduling app.\n\n[System Prompt: Starter Cache Located!]\n[Welcome to the Ledger's Frontier Tutorial Zone, Indentured Soul!]\n[Would you like to claim your Basic Survival Provisions?]\n[Includes: 1x Rations (Meager), 1x Water Skin (Stale), 1x Flint Dagger (Poor).]\n\nRhea stares at the floating blue text. Her throat is lined with sandpaper. Her stomach performs a hollow, desperate gymnastics routine. The offer is a lifeline. A canteen and a knife are the difference between bleeding out in an ash dune and actually making it to tomorrow. Even stale water sounds like a vintage wine right now.\n\nThe prompt helpfully displays her ongoing existential nightmare in the margins, just to ensure she understands her leverage in this negotiation.\n\n[Current Soul Debt: 100,000]\n\nRight. The debt. The invisible chains the System slapped on her the moment she fell out of the sky and survived the impact. She doesn't know the exchange rate. She doesn't know if a hundred thousand is a mortgage or a candy bar, but the title 'Indentured Soul' heavily implies she isn't in the wealth-building phase of this new reality. \n\nShe steps up to the pedestal and raises her right arm. The System Indenture Brand on her left wrist itches with phantom heat as the holographic parchment waits, the word 'Accept' pulsing in an inviting, friendly font at the bottom of the screen. Her fingers tremble. She just needs a drink of water. She just needs a weapon to fight off whatever made the faint footprints she can see leading away from the crater.\n\nRhea stops her hovering hand from hitting Accept, her eyes locking onto the tiny asterisk tucked into the bottom right corner of the glowing box.\n\nIt\u2019s barely a pixel wide. A microscopic star of legal doom, perfectly camouflaged against the glowing blue border. The math was already bad, but suddenly, the math looks exactly like a trap.\n\nSTATE_PATCH:\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"world_updates\": {\n    \"location\": \"LOC_TUTORIAL_CRATER_RIDGE\",\n    \"cast_present\": [\n      \"char_rhea\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"character_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"char_rhea\",\n      \"chapter\": 1,\n      \"scene\": 3,\n      \"inventory\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": \"ITEM_cracked_smartphone\",\n          \"container\": \"blazer_pocket_right\",\n          \"status\": \"stowed\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"containers\": [\n        {\n          \"container\": \"blazer_pocket_right\",\n          \"owner\": \"char_rhea\",\n          \"contents\": [\n            \"ITEM_cracked_smartphone\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"invariants_add\": [],\n      \"persona_updates\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"character_continuity_system_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"char_rhea\",\n      \"set\": {\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"hp\": {\n            \"current\": 1,\n            \"max\": 100\n          }\n        },\n        \"resources\": {\n          \"soul_debt\": {\n            \"current\": 100000,\n            \"max\": 100000\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"reason\": \"HP and Soul Debt displayed in System Prompt without changes.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary_update\": {\n    \"last_scene\": [\n      \"Rhea climbed the steep ash slope to the crater's ridge, discovering a glowing Starter Cache pedestal.\",\n      \"The System offered her basic survival provisions, displaying her critical 1 HP and 100,000 Soul Debt.\",\n      \"Just before accepting the desperately needed gear, she noticed a tiny, hidden asterisk attached to the terms.\"\n    ],\n    \"key_events\": [\n      \"Rhea reached the Crater Ridge and located a glowing Starter Cache pedestal.\",\n      \"A System Prompt offered her basic survival provisions: meager rations, stale water, and a poor flint dagger.\",\n      \"Rhea spotted a microscopic asterisk next to the 'Accept' button, realizing the offer was a trap.\"\n    ],\n    \"must_stay_true\": [\n      \"inventory: char_rhea -> Cracked Smartphone (status=stowed, container=blazer_pocket_right)\",\n      \"container: blazer_pocket_right (owner=char_rhea, contents=[ITEM_cracked_smartphone])\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea HP is 1/100\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea has active status Tutorial Grace Period\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea has active title Indentured Soul\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea has 100,000 Soul Debt\",\n      \"injury: char_rhea bruised left leg\",\n      \"milestone: starter_cache_discovered = DONE\"\n    ],\n    \"chapter_so_far_add\": []\n  }\n}\n```",
